    "created_at": "2017-10-11T18:15:01Z",
    "updated_at": "2017-10-11T18:15:01Z",
    "body": "@beverloo That's definitely an improvement, but I'm not sure \"if the platform is able to\" goes far enough. Sites need to code to this API under the assumption that their code will not run when a notification is closed, since that's the case on several platforms. I'd prefer the text say that UAs MAY run these steps, with perhaps a Note saying it's quite unlikely on some platforms.",
